OL,5,G1700 Auschwitz: The Nazis and the Final
OL,6,G     Solution
OL,7,     FCorruption: Exploring the
OL,8,     Fevolution of Auschwitz and how it
OL,9,     Frelated to the Nazis' campaign of
OL,10,     Fextermination. Corruption was rife
OL,11,     Famong the SS officers working at
OL,12,     Fthe camp.
